		<r3d:repositoryName language="eng">Codex</r3d:repositoryName>
				<r3d:additionalName language="eng">A comprehensive and functional compendium of Next Generation Sequencing experiments.</r3d:additionalName>
				<r3d:repositoryUrl>https://codex.stemcells.cam.ac.uk/</r3d:repositoryUrl>
				<r3d:description language="eng">CODEX is a database of NGS mouse and human experiments. Although, the main focus of CODEX is Haematopoiesis and Embryonic systems, the database includes a large variety of cell types. In addition to the publically available data, CODEX also includes a private site hosting non-published data. CODEX provides access to processed and curated NGS experiments. To use CODEX: (i) select a specialized repository (HAEMCODE or ESCODE) or choose the whole compendium (CODEX), then (ii) filter by organism and (iii) choose how to explore the database.</r3d:description>
